%% The states of an alert, from packages/agents/src/human-state.ts, human-decision.ts, autonomy.ts and list-change.ts.
stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> New: alert raised in the bank data
  New --> UnderReview: a review is started
  UnderReview --> Held: Zetaris unreachable (no record)
  UnderReview --> Proposed: recommendation sealed
  Held --> UnderReview
  Proposed --> Decided: a person approves or overrides, with a reason
  Proposed --> BlockPending: a block recommended and approved once
  Proposed --> OverridePending: an override that lowers caution (to a close)
  BlockPending --> Decided: a second, different approver confirms or declines
  OverridePending --> Decided: a second, different approver confirms or declines
  Proposed --> AutoClosed: automatic close (level 1, off by default)
  AutoClosed --> Proposed: a person reopens it
  Decided --> ListChange: a listed entry changes
  ListChange --> UnderReview: listed for a person on request, then reviewed again
  Decided --> [*]
  note right of Decided
    escalated, closed, need more information,
    or block recommended: always by a person
  end note
